cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Emulsion Presets: 451 open-source Lightroom film presets"
message: >-
  If you use these presets in teaching, research, or writing, please cite this
  repository. Each preset ships with a research dossier recording its sources.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Woodward
    given-names: Patrick
    alias: peva3
repository-code: "https://github.com/peva3/EmulsionPresets"
url: "https://peva3.github.io/EmulsionPresets/"
license: MIT
version: 3.1.4
date-released: 2026-10-21
abstract: >-
  A collection of 451 Adobe Lightroom .xmp presets covering film stock emulation
  (Kodak, Fujifilm, Ilford, Agfa, CineStill), cinematic colour grading, historic
  photographic processes, genre-specific looks, decade emulations and regional
  colour palettes. Every preset declares ProcessVersion 15.4, a camera-profile
  Look block and neutral tone curve baselines, and is documented with a sourced
  research dossier describing the film behaviour it targets.
keywords:
  - lightroom
  - presets
  - xmp
  - film emulation
  - color grading
  - photography
  - kodak
  - fujifilm
  - ilford
  - open source
